    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36262" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pictūrātus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		pictura, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>painted</i>, <i>pictured</i>, i. e.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Party-colored</i>, <i>variegated</i>
				(<b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agger floribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 6, 58</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">volucres,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Ep. ad Ser. 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Embroidered</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 3, 483</span></i>
			.</div>
